      *
        SEND-REPORT-TO-PRINTER SECTION.
        SRTP-005.
      *   MOVE "PRINTERNAME SELECTED" TO WS-MESSAGE
      *   PERFORM ERROR1-000
      *   MOVE WS-PRINTERSELECTED TO WS-MESSAGE
      *   PERFORM ERROR-MESSAGE.          
         IF WS-PRINTERSELECTED = 0 OR = 88
              GO TO SRTP-999.
      *   WS-PRINTER-SAVE IS THE ACTUAL PRINTER NAME
      *   WS-PRINTER IS THE FILE NAME BEING PRINTED
      *****************************************************************
      *  The section of PrintPdf.sh added to convert automatically ALL
      *  print jobs that are simple text based to .pdf files so that
      *   they can esaily be printed by the  photo copy
      * type printers EG:  MP2021,   MP201,    MP171 etc
      *  WE DID THIS AS THE DOT MATRIX PRINTERS WERE ARE OLD AND
      * WERE COSTING A LOT TO FIX SO AS THE PHOTOCOPIER,PRINTER, FAX
      * MACHINES WE HAVE FROM NASHUA HAVE AN ALL-IN PRICE COPY
      * QUIANTITIES SO IT MADE SENSE TO SCRAP THJ DOT MATRIX PRN'S
      * WHEN THEY BROKE.
      *  THE USER MUST SELECT PRN #15 FOR THIS TO WORK
      ****************************************************************** 
         IF WS-PRINTERSELECTED = 15
           MOVE 
          CONCATENATE('PrintPdf.sh ', ' ', TRIM(WS-PRINTER), 
              ' ', TRIM(WS-PRINTER-SAVE), ' ', TRIM(WS-PRINTERSELECTED))
              TO WS-COMMAND-LINE.

          IF WS-PRINTERSELECTED = 15
              CALL "SYSTEM" USING WS-COMMAND-LINE
                         RETURNING W-STATUS
             GO TO SRTP-500.
        SRTP-008.
              DISPLAY WS-COMMAND-LINE
          IF WS-PRINTERSELECTED NOT = 15
              MOVE "lp -d "        TO W-PRINTCOM1A
              MOVE WS-PRINTER-SAVE TO W-PRINTCOM1
              MOVE WS-PRINTER      TO W-PRINTCOM2.
        SRTP-010.          
      *    DISPLAY "PRINT COMMAND: " W-PRINTCOMMAND AT 2710.
      *    ACCEPT W-ENTER AT 2810

          CALL "SYSTEM" USING W-PRINTCOMMAND 
             RETURNING W-STATUS
             END-CALL.
        SRTP-500.         
      *     DISPLAY "STATUS of CALL: " AT 2620
      *     DISPLAY W-STATUS AT 2635
      *     ACCEPT W-ENTER AT 2680.
        SRTP-999.
            EXIT.
